    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "（但一本ニハ二金十七石五斗九升一合二勺四才但金以下ハ全ク同シ）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "（但し、一本には二金十七石五斗九升一合二勺四才、但し金以下は全く同じ）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Small-type note: \"However, in one manuscript copy [the figure reads] 二金 seventeen koku 5 to 9 sho 1 go 2 shaku 4 sai; but from the gold entry downward the figures are entirely the same.\" Transcribed as printed: the 金 stands where a numeral (百) would be expected, which would give 217.59124 koku against the 224.02948 koku printed here."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "此五ヶ年平均割註"
